00:44.070" end="00:44.370">Gs</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.550" end="00:46.050"><span begin="00:44.550" end="00:44.700">Get </span><span begin="00:44.700" end="00:44.760">the </span><span begin="00:44.760" end="00:45.030">money </span><span begin="00:45.030" end="00:45.180">out</span><span begin="00:45.180" end="00:45.180">, </span><span begin="00:45.180" end="00:45.330">put </span><span begin="00:45.330" end="00:45.390">the </span><span begin="00:45.390" end="00:45.630">money </span><span begin="00:45.630" end="00:45.720">in </span><span begin="00:45.720" end="00:45.870">his </span><span begin="00:45.870" end="00:46.050">mout</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.050" end="00:47.850"><span begin="00:46.050" end="00:46.200">Then </span><span begin="00:46.200" end="00:46.710">suffocate </span><span begin="00:46.710" end="00:46.890">man </span><span begin="00:46.890" end="00:47.040">with </span><span begin="00:47.040" end="00:47.310">about </span><span begin="00:47.310" end="00:47.520">two </span><span begin="00:47.520" end="00:47.850">Gs</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.000" end="00:49.560"><span begin="00:48.000" end="00:48.480">Suffocate </span><span begin="00:48.480" end="00:48.630">man </span><span begin="00:48.630" end="00:48.780">with </span><span begin="00:48.780" end="00:49.020">about </span><span begin="00:49.020" end="00:49.230">four </span><span begin="00:49.230" end="00:49.560">Gs</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.710" end="00:51.420"><span begin="00:49.710" end="00:50.160">Suffocate </span><span begin="00:50.160" end="00:50.310">man</span><span begin="00:50.310" end="00:50.310">, </span><span begin="00:50.310" end="00:50.460">then </span><span begin="00:50.460" end="00:50.520">I </span><span begin="00:50.520" end="00:50.730">might </span><span begin="00:50.730" end="00:50.940">just </span><span begin="00:50.940" end="00:51.420">breeze</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.570" end="00:52.950"><span begin="00:51.570" end="00:51.780">I'll </span><span begin="00:51.780" end="00:52.050">bury </span><span begin="00:52.050" end="00:52.230">man </span><span begin="00:52.230" end="00:52.410">two </span><span begin="00:52.410" end="00:52.620">foot </span><span begin="00:52.620" end="00:52.950">shallow</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.010" end="00:54.810"><span begin="00:53.010" end="00:53.220">Ain't </span><span begin="00:53.220" end="00:53.400">got </span><span begin="00:53.400" end="00:53.640">time </span><span begin="00:53.640" end="00:53.760">to </span><span begin="00:53.760" end="00:53.910">dig </span><span begin="00:53.910" end="00:54.180">six </span><span begin="00:54.180" end="00:54.390">feet </span><span begin="00:54.390" end="00:54.810">deep</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.840" end="00:57.510"><span begin="00:54.840" end="00:55.170">These </span><span begin="00:55.170" end="00:55.650">MCs </span><span begin="00:55.650" end="00:55.800">and </span><span begin="00:55.800" end="00:56.160">rappers </span><span begin="00:56.160" end="00:56.370">wanna </span><span begin="00:56.370" end="00:56.610">chat </span><span begin="00:56.610" end="00:56.820">'bout </span><span begin="00:56.820" end="00:56.970">their </span><span begin="00:56.970" end="00:57.510">syllables</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.600" end="00:59.220"><span begin="00:57.600" end="00:57.750">And </span><span begin="00:57.750" end="00:57.870">their </span><span begin="00:57.870" end="00:58.380">multis </span><span begin="00:58.380" end="00:58.530">and </span><span begin="00:58.530" end="00:58.680">their </span><span begin="00:58.680" end="00:59.220">similes</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.220" end="01:01.740"><span begin="00:59.220" end="00:59.400">And </span><span begin="00:59.400" end="00:59.610">all </span><span begin="00:59.610" end="00:59.790">that </span><span begin="00:59.790" end="00:59.820">*</span><span begin="00:59.820" end="00:59.850">*</span><span begin="00:59.850" end="00:59.880"